# Runtime state created by the private-browser path. MUST NOT be tracked, and
# MUST NOT live inside the app dir at all: Turbopack indexes the project root
# and a `next build` dies on the first file it cannot read (Chromium/container
# files are 0600 while the build runs as the service user) — confirmed live
# 2026-09-24. BROWSER_PROFILE_BASE_DIR already points at /var/spaceworker/profiles
# and browser-server derives its sessions dir beside it; these entries are
# defence in depth for older checkouts and for local dev.
browser-profiles/
browser-sessions-tmp/
